Acknowledgement

This book is not just written, it was taught and lived. I had
the privilege of mentoring an exceptional team of young
men and women over different times on certain onsite
and online platforms. It is relevant parts of the content
taught over the years at these platforms that were
worked into the books, of which this is one. I want to
appreciate these uncommon proteges and everyone at
the Wisdom Place, House of Insights, and other mentoring
platforms, most of whom were the first set of people I
shared the insights that are harvested into the pages of
this book.

The importance of a purpose-driven team to any project
cannot be overestimated. I appreciate my ever-
resourceful writing and editing team: Otiti Aburime,
Rachael Oyetade, Joyce Fiyinfoluwa Oyetunji, Ifejesu
Majua Odejide and Precious Abayowa who also did the
design of this book.

I do not trivialise the sacrifice of my family in allowing me
to do all I do. To my ever loving wife, OluwaNifemi, thank
you for your understanding and support. To my adorable
sons, Wonders and Wisdom, your lives keep encouraging
me never to give up.
