                               MEDITATIONS ON GRACE

Preface

Grace is the spiritual enablement of God to do and be all
he wants us to be. It is every and any good thing from God
towards man (Jam 1:17). 2Cor 13:14 say “May the grace of
our Lord Jesus Christ, and the love of God, and the
communion of the Holy Ghost, be with you all”.
We need God’s saving grace, enabling grace, forgiving
grace and every form of grace. Grace is all we need.

These meditations when applied effectively will yield the
result of abundant grace and in your life. Do well to find a
suitable atmosphere and engage effectively. Prayerfully
confess and prophetically declare these scriptures into
your life routinely and continually.

It takes time for the things of the spirit to crystalise so
these meditations will become tangible in your life after a
length of time of use.
